                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "From ballooning health care costs to mass federal layoffs, American are at risk. We can no longer choose partisanship over logic, strategic threats over productive discussion, and executive power over the American people. With 21,000 Marylanders in my district at risk of seeing their premiums rise, now more than ever we must fight to keep costs down and extend ACA tax credits.",
