                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Yesterday I was pleased to join @KarenLewisYoung, @DelegateKen, @drmeenasesh, and other leaders for a tour of Frederick Health Hospital \u2014 one of 25 locations in Frederick Health\u2019s network.\n\nWhen we fight for health care, this is what we\u2019re fighting for: dedicated advocates and an across-the-board effort to keep our communities healthy. From Medicaid to ACA tax credits, I\u2019m proud to support essential health care funding in Washington and bring Frederick Health\u2019s voice back to Congress.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": [
                    "KarenLewisYoung",
                    "DelegateKen",
                    "drmeenasesh"
                ],
