                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 0,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This morning I was proud to host a County Convening in Frederick, attended by over 50 community leaders, nonprofit advocates, and local stakeholders.\n\nIn the face of federal cuts to health care, food assistance, and education among other issues, we must stand unified and lift up one another. That looks like this: community-level collaboration to highlight our priorities and meet the needs of our neighbors.",
