                "text": "I\u2019m proud to share that over $6 million in federal dollars \u2014 maintaining full spending levels approved in July \u2014 has been signed into law for agriculture-related projects in Maryland\u2019s 6th!\n\nThis is an incredible win for the health, safety, and strength of our communities, and I\u2019m hoping to keep the good news flowing as we await final approval for the 8 other projects I requested for my district.",
