                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Garrett Medical Group is going the extra mile this holiday season, showing up in heart and spirit by supporting Medicare patients and fighting food insecurity. Every meal delivered makes a difference, and I am could not be more proud to represent such a dedicated and compassionate community.\n\nhttps://t.co/wYTplZnajP",
