                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As Congress considers ways to extend ACA tax credits, I am in agreement with Senator @ChrisVanHollen that our healthcare system is breaking under the weight of devastating cuts to Medicaid and Medicare.\u00a0\u00a0Families are losing access to health coverage and rural health providers are at risk of closing or cutting essential services. \n\nHealth care is an essential human dignity and right, and in Maryland \u201cwe leave no one behind.\u201d That\u2019s why I signed on to the Medicare for All Act, to work to solve our country\u2019s health care crisis.\u00a0\u00a0\n\n@MedicareGov #Medicare4ALL",
                "text_lang": "en",
