                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I stand with my fellow @HouseDemocrats. If Mike Johnson continues to ignore bipartisan pleas to extend ACA tax credits and end this health care crisis, Americans will pay the price for his incompetence on January 1st. Our country deserves better.",
