                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "With recent attacks on health care and other federal services, Marylanders are looking for answers. That\u2019s why I hosted a county convening for community members across Garrett and Allegany counties on Friday \u2014 to ensure that my actions in Congress meet the needs of Mountain Maryland.\n\nThis is the third of my county convenings this year, and I feel blessed to be surrounded by such an active community, speaking up and fighting for their neighbors.",
